        "exact_quote": "\nx\n\nX\n\nx\n\nX\n\nx\n\nPage 5 of 17\n\n\fOpen Research Europe 2024, 4:24 Last updated: 13 NOV 2024\n\nFigure 1. Example of Type 1 post on Facebook.\n\nType 2 posts (Figure 2) was image content related to\nthe project research activities and research equipment\nused in the project together with short text caption of the\nimage.\nType 3 posts (Figure 3) was image content "
      },
      {
        "source_id": "S007",
        "source_file": "data/originals/ore/social_sciences/4-24_What_type_of_social_media_posts_about_sustainable_construction_is_bett/v1_manuscript.pdf",
